"<div id=\"main\"><section class=\"wrap outcome-hero split\" data-hero><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><a class=\"link text-sm\" href=\"/#solutions\">← Explore solutions</a><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Worker site check-in</p><h1 class=\"display outcome-title\">Know who checked in,<br><span class=\"text-blue\">where and when.</span></h1><p class=\"copy\">Bring site activity into view. Connect each check-in and check-out to a worker and workplace, then return to the visit history when you need it.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2\"><a class=\"cta\" href=\"#demo\">See site check-in <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"link\" href=\"#record\">See how it works ↓</a></div><p class=\"text-sm text-slate\">For site managers, operations and workforce teams.</p></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">At the point of work</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"sheet\"><div class=\"person\"><span class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">JT</span><div><p class=\"font-semibold\">Jamie Taylor</p><p class=\"text-xs text-slate\">Care assistant</p></div></div><div class=\"my-6 flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"flex h-16 w-16 shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-2 border-blue text-3xl text-blue\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↳</span><div><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">North site</p><h3 id=\"attendance-state\" class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold\">On site now</h3></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-line pt-5\"><div class=\"flex justify-between gap-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-slate\">Check-in</p><p class=\"font-mono text-lg\">08:02</p></div><div class=\"mt-4 flex justify-between gap-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-slate\">Check-out</p><p id=\"checkout-time\" class=\"text-sm text-slate\">Not yet recorded</p></div></div><p class=\"mt-6 border-l-2 border-blue pl-4 text-sm text-slate\">A person, a place and a time.<br>A visit you can refer back to.</p><button id=\"attendance-preview\" class=\"demo-choice mt-5 w-full\" aria-pressed=\"false\">See the check-out record →</button><p id=\"attendance-announcement\" role=\"status\" class=\"sr-only\"></p></div></div></figure></section><nav aria-label=\"On this page\" class=\"sticky top-0 z-30 border-y border-line bg-white\"><div class=\"wrap outcome-nav\"><a href=\"#record\" data-chapter-link=\"record\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs\">01</span>Record the visit</a><a href=\"#presence\" data-chapter-link=\"presence\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs\">02</span>View attendance</a><a href=\"#visits\" data-chapter-link=\"visits\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs\">03</span>Keep the history</a></div></nav><div class=\"wrap\"><section id=\"record\" data-chapter class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"chapter-number\">01 / Capture the visit</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Connect the person,<br>the place and the time.</h2><p class=\"copy\">Record a worker’s check-in against the site they attend. Give the office and site team a shared record to refer to when they need to check an arrival.</p><p class=\"border-l-2 border-blue pl-4 text-sm text-slate\">Choose the check-in setup with your team based on the site and the workers who use it.</p></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Give each visit a clear reference</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><ol class=\"sheet flex flex-col gap-7\"><li class=\"point\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">01</p><h3 class=\"mt-1 text-lg font-semibold\">Identify the person</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate\">Connect the visit to the worker’s record.</p></li><li class=\"point\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">02</p><h3 class=\"mt-1 text-lg font-semibold\">Record the site</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate\">Keep the workplace attached to the event.</p></li><li class=\"point\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">03</p><h3 class=\"mt-1 text-lg font-semibold\">Keep the time</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate\">Record arrival and departure as separate events.</p></li></ol></div></figure></section><section id=\"presence\" data-chapter class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"chapter-number\">02 / See the latest activity</p><h2 class=\"heading\">See who has arrived.<br>Follow who has left.</h2><p class=\"copy\">Open the site view to review recorded attendance. Distinguish people who have checked in from those with a recorded check-out.</p><p class=\"border-l-2 border-blue pl-4 text-sm text-slate\">The view depends on people recording their arrivals and departures. A missing check-out needs your team’s attention.</p></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Look at the site as a whole</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"sheet\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">North site / Today</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold\">Review the latest activity</h3><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Jamie Taylor</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Checked in · 08:02</p></div><span class=\"badge \">On site</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Alex Morgan</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Checked in · 08:16</p></div><span class=\"badge \">On site</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Riley Ellis</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Checked out · 12:04</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Left site</span></div><p class=\"mt-5 text-sm text-slate\">Status follows recorded check-in and check-out activity.</p></div></div></figure></section><section id=\"visits\" data-chapter class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"chapter-number\">03 / Return to the history</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Keep the visit<br>after the working day.</h2><p class=\"copy\">Follow the check-in and check-out history for a person and site. Keep the details available when a manager needs to review a visit.</p><p class=\"border-l-2 border-blue pl-4 text-sm text-slate\">A visit record shows attendance events. Your team uses the surrounding context to resolve questions about work or time.</p></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Keep the completed visit in context</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"sheet\"><div class=\"person\"><span class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">JT</span><div><p class=\"font-semibold\">Jamie Taylor</p><p class=\"text-xs text-slate\">Care assistant</p></div></div><dl class=\"mt-2\"><div class=\"record-row\"><dt class=\"text-sm text-slate\">Site</dt><dd class=\"font-semibold\">North site</dd></div><div class=\"record-row\"><dt class=\"text-sm text-slate\">Visit date</dt><dd class=\"font-semibold\">9 Oct 2026</dd></div><div class=\"record-row\"><dt class=\"text-sm text-slate\">Check-in</dt><dd class=\"font-mono\">08:02</dd></div><div class=\"record-row\"><dt class=\"text-sm text-slate\">Check-out</dt><dd class=\"font-mono\">16:31</dd></div></dl><p class=\"mt-5 border-l-2 border-blue pl-4 text-sm text-slate\">Return to the person and the visit when you need to review the record.</p></div></div></figure></section><section class=\"split py-12 md:py-16\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Keep the work connected</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Connect the visit to the person.</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-3\"><p class=\"copy\">See how people hold their own credentials and share evidence for work.</p><a class=\"link\" href=\"/outcomes/portable-worker-credentials/\">Explore the worker app <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a><a class=\"link text-sm\" href=\"/\">Explore the full Certifyd story →</a></div></section></div><section id=\"demo\" class=\"bg-ink py-16 text-white md:py-20\"><div class=\"wrap split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-[#93BBFF]\">Bring your workflow</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Bring one site.<br>Walk through an arrival.</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-6\"><p class=\"max-w-[43ch] text-lg text-white/80\">Tell us how workers arrive and who needs to see the attendance record. We’ll explore the check-in setup and the team’s view.</p><a class=\"cta bg-white text-ink hover:bg-sky\" href=\"https://cal.com/andrew-speer/certifyd-discovery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Book a check-in demo <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><p class=\"text-sm text-white/75\">A 20-minute conversation with the Certifyd team.</p></div></div></section></div><dialog id=\"screen-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"screen-title\" class=\"m-auto max-h-[94dvh] w-[min(96vw,90rem)] overflow-auto rounded-sm border border-line bg-white p-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-6 pb-5\"><h2 id=\"screen-title\" class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Set the requirements for each role</h2><button autofocus data-close class=\"cta\">Close</button></div><img src=\"/images/connected/roles.png\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1144\" alt=\"Certifyd role selection screen showing Nurse selected\" class=\"h-auto w-full\"></dialog>"
